WEBVTT

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:39.500
Yuzuha...

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.850
I will kill you.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:01.280
Thank you.

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:31.810
Calm down, Taiji-kun!

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.140
Get out of my way!

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:34.020
Son of a bitch.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:35.360
It's funny, isn't it?

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:37.400
You're the one who cares about your family!

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:39.840
In the end, I'll destroy 10,000 families!

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.060
Stop it, Colossal Head!

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:44.210
Destruction!

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:45.620
You too, you too!

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:47.280
Why are you so scared?

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:49.720
You're going to kill your sister!

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:52.590
You're the one who's going to protect Yuzuha!

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.520
You tried to kill me first?

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:09.580
I thought I was going to die.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.720
Why do you kill each other in a brotherly fight?

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.820
It's strange, isn't it?

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:28.630
Hanagaki, this is our brother.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.130
It's the path I chose!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:40.400
I'll protect you.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:44.770
I'm Yuzuha!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:47.460
Even in the original history...

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:49.670
Yuzuha was the one who killed Taizou.

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:52.170
But in the present...

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:53.880
Hakkai was the one who killed him.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.780
Yuzuha has been left behind by Kisaki

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.660
I killed Aiji.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.840
Hakkai covered it up.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:06.950
And so Hakkai became a princess who knew the truth.

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.480
And then I cast Black Dragon.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.540
I dyed Toman into evil.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.600
Everything was to protect Yuzuha!

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:21.420
I know what I have to do, Hakkai.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:21.660
What?

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:28.170
I'll blow up Aiji!

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:29.880
Yuzuha...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.250
If I protect you, Hakkai will not be stained by evil!

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:34.520
You...

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:37.260
How can you do that?

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.580
You don't know!

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:41.220
Your brother Yamata!

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:46.650
Don't talk nonsense, Hanagaki

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.210
Yuzo!

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:55.100
Hakkai will protect you!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:01.200
I...

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:03.570
Mamoru...

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:13.650
Don't say that.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:21.170
Nya-kun!

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:28.620
Let go of my hand, Yuzuha.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.000
My hand is cut off.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:33.260
Thank you for watching until the end.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:49.600
Mitsuya-kun is here!

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:51.090
Takemichi.

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:53.320
Please take care of Yuzuha.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:55.000
Ai!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:04.410
Well then, I'll be your opponent, you bastard.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:11.900
Are you serious? What about the rescue agreement?

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:17.450
Don't tell me you're going to break the promise you made?

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:19.960
Shut up.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.130
Rather than that promise, I'll tell you the obvious.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.110
You can always help your sister.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.630
I'll forgive you no matter how bad it is.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:36.740
That's my brother, you idiot!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:44.570
Kiki, didn't you hear the sound of Nitsuya's inflator?

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:48.070
What? You're the one who's trying to run in this cold weather.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.520
It's just my imagination.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.060
I see. It's just your imagination.

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:55.630
Let's go home.

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:59.050
It's dangerous because there aren't many cars and there's a lot of snow on the road.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:02.240
What? What are you yelling at Kenshin?

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:04.840
What? That's why I'm saying it's crazy!

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:06.840
My face is too bad!

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.760
You're so stupid, idiot!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:56.940
They're crossing each other!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:07:59.940
Why are you just standing there?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.840
What are you doing, Takemichi?

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:05.900
Chibuyu! Are you okay, Chibuyu?

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:10.800
Yeah, I'm not okay, but Kisaki and Hanma betrayed me and tied me up.

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:12.860
Mitsuya-kun saved me.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:14.530
Mitsuya-kun?

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:28.480
But why is Mitsuya-kun here?

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:29.810
I called him.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:30.560
Eh?

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.850
We have to draw the back of Kisaki.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.240
The back?

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:36.020
Idiot!

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.240
Even though he's a Japanese soldier!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.100
Japanese soldiers have nothing to do with us.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:45.160
Our goal is to get Black Dragon out of the future.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:46.840
That's right, but...

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:48.300
It's the Japanese soldier that Mitsuya-kun decided.

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.930
If he wins, everyone will be convinced.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:53.280
Ah...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.600
Come on, Mitsuya! I've only got 70% of my strength left!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:09.410
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:12.140
I just lost my boots belt.

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:18.870
Stop it, Taka-chan! I can't do this! I can't beat my brother!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:28.960
You're more powerful than me, aren't you? I won't fight like that!

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:04.600
Shut up, Hakkai.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:06.920
Don't you get it?

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:10.760
You have to stay strong!

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:17.600
Because you're watching, Tsuya-kun.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.370
You're smart and you can calculate.

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:22.490
You have to stay strong after you understand!

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.400
For your sake.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.230
For your brother's sake!

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.330
Mitsuya-kun won't lose.

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:40.070
Yeah, he'll never lose.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:48.930
He's a tough guy.

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:54.940
You're tired, aren't you?

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:57.860
It's about time to end this, right?

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:04.020
I'm going to kill you.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:34.420
What do you think of my information?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.170
It's worth 100,000, right?

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:44.120
Toshio Takemichi!

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:45.580
The baby won't move!

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:51.450
Of course. I hit him hard.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:56.060
As expected of Inui!

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:58.530
I'll kill them all!

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.220
What the hell are you doing to me?

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:07.300
Hehehehe

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.990
Come at me, you idiots!

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:12.180
Black Dragon!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:14.460
I won't forgive you for this!

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:19.950
You guys!

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:23.210
Michira-kun!

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:25.070
I'm angry.

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:29.880
That's why.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.040
Calm down for a moment.

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:34.810
Don't push yourself too hard!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:45.060
Takemichi, calm down and listen carefully.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:45.760
Yes.

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.700
The situation is hopeless.

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:50.120
Taishu is a monster.

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:52.390
I don't know what the other two will do.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.560
On the other hand, we are...

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:58.240
Chifuyu is broken.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.240
To be honest, I can't move. Only Takemichi is still in a tight spot.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:09.860
But if I lose here, Yuzuha will be in even worse shape.

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:12.450
It's not strange even if I get killed.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:17.490
It's okay! Mikey-kun and the others will come.

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:20.310
That's why we have to be patient until then.

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:23.340
If everyone comes, we can do something about it.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:27.550
Takemichi?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:27.990
Mikey?

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.220
Did you call him?

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:32.950
Eh? Didn't you call him, Mitsuya-kun?

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:36.230
I came alone to save Hakkai.

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:39.140
It has nothing to do with Touman.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:40.810
It's a personal problem.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:44.150
The three of us will protect Yuzuha.

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:46.640
He's dead?

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:49.000
It's over.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:56.180
When Mitsuya-kun came, I had a faint expectation.

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.460
That everyone in Touman would come.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.420
That's why I'm going to do my best until then.

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:04.030
Get up, Takemichi.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:06.650
I was expecting a little bit, too.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:10.710
But if this happens, we have no choice but to do something about it.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:13.270
There's no way we can do something about it, right?

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:14.540
I'm the only one who's in trouble.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.790
Are you telling me to do it with the three of them?

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:22.240
I can't do that.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:28.380
Takemichi, I don't want to carry it all on you.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:36.390
If you and Chifuyu stop those two in the way, I'll take care of Taiji.

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:40.150
That's impossible with your body, Mitsuya-kun!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.850
Yeah, I can't do it alone.

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:47.150
Please lend me your strength, Hakkai.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:53.160
I'm a member of Black Dragon.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:56.440
I'm not in a position to cooperate with us.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:59.380
But Yuzuha...

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:04.140
Lend me your strength to protect my sister, Hakkai!

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:09.350
I... I...

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:12.540
I know you're not afraid of Taisho.

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.530
You've never been able to resist him.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:21.900
But still, you've been protecting Yuzuha all this time!

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:29.040
You can overcome Taisho!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.300
Yuka-chan, it's not like that!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.180
You can do it, Hakkai!

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:46.280
I'm sorry for spilling the beans!

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:47.670
I'm pathetic!

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:52.170
Heh, that's the situation.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:56.520
Let's go, Takimichi.

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:57.000
Yeah!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.440
Don't overdo it, Chigui.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:00.830
It's all over the place.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.920
I'm the one who killed Mitsuya-kun.

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.200
Takemichi is the one with the 100,000 yen bill.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:06.780
Hm?

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.220
He's motivated.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:09.840
I got it.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.990
That black-haired guy sold the information about Taiji for money.

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.400
He's probably the type of person who would give up if he were to become a bad guy.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.380
Yeah, I think so too.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:22.400
Mitsuya-kun and the others are the ones who had to wait until they killed Taiji.

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:23.620
You can do it, right?

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:24.300
Yeah!

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:25.490
Let's go!

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:35.910
It's been a while since we've fought together.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:39.070
Huh? Hacker?

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:47.240
Don't tell me you're going to go against me!

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:53.310
Don't worry. You're stronger than Taishi.

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:10.180
You're going to stick to me like that forever?

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:13.250
I'm the last one to hold you back.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:15.380
I'm already out of luck.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.050
Mitsya-kun! Hakkai!

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.310
Don't take too long!

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:20.470
Hurry up!

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:22.380
I see.

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.340
Time saving, huh?

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:29.310
It's okay, Hakkai.

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:31.640
You can beat Taisho

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:32.860
Be confident

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:36.960
Let's go, Hakkai!

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:59.000
Mitsuya, what do you want from Hakkai?

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.040
Did you expect that?

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:06.100
Michiraku!

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:13.540
Matsuno Chifuyu

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:16.440
I wanted to fight you when you were in a tight spot

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.260
I'm sorry.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:45.820
I can do it too!

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.540
I can do it too!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:59.380
Kimichi!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.240
I-

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:04.560
Don't you get it, Hakkai?

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:09.890
If you do something like this, you'll become a useless person!

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.140
It's not like this!

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:15.800
If you're going to fight, you're going to fight!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.200
What do you mean by that?

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:33.860
I'll show you!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:37.560
Huh?

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.560
You're still not coming back, you piece of shit!

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:44.840
I know you're going to lose.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.440
You came to see me, didn't you?

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:49.530
You still won't come back?

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:53.010
That's all I can do!

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:57.920
Let's go, Taishi!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:19:58.960
Yeah!

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:01.860
TAKAMETCHI!

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:29.160
Dumb process.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.890
If you don't, you'll die.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:41.010
Liar!

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:51.000
Why are you trying so hard?

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:52.310
Even though you're weak.

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:54.380
That's enough!

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:55.440
Stop it!

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:08.490
It's over, Kimichi.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.910
I'll do my best.

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:15.370
We lost.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:30.440
I wanted to do it.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:37.240
It's the same as the one I gave you.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:46.530
Hey, Kiyo.

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:56.430
I can't do it because I have Black Dragon.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:10.000
Taiju, I will defeat you and get the Black Dragon!

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:16.460
Takemichi...
